<title>USA: USDA accepts DEIP dry milk bids to Latin America.</title>
<headline>USDA accepts DEIP dry milk bids to Latin America.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Agriculture Department Wednesday said it accepted two bids from Interfood Inc to sell 210 tonnes of nonfat dry milk to buyers in Caribbean, Central and South American nations.</p>
<p>USDA said the bonus was $775 per tonne and delivery was set for Jan. 15 - April 15.</p>
<p>The remaining DEIP balance for the region was 47,315 tonnes.</p>
